[
  {
    "id": 48,
    "text": "The loudest storms often rage within us—only through silence can we calm their fury and chart a course for growth.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.598672",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.598672",
    "uid": "quote-000048"
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "text": "Every moment of silence you embrace becomes a stepping stone toward becoming the person you aspire to be.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.618303",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.618303",
    "uid": "quote-000052"
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "text": "The journey from reaction to reflection is paved with moments of silence—each step a victory over impulsivity.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.638502",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.638502",
    "uid": "quote-000056"
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "text": "Personal growth thrives in the soil of solitude, nurtured by silence and watered with self-awareness.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.658976",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.658976",
    "uid": "quote-000060"
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "text": "Every challenge faced in silence builds resilience, crafting a spirit unshaken by life’s tempests.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.677948",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.677948",
    "uid": "quote-000064"
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "text": "Embrace silence as a teacher, guiding you gently toward truths too delicate for the clamor of everyday life.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.696881",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.696881",
    "uid": "quote-000068"
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "text": "Personal evolution requires the courage to confront oneself in the mirror of silence without flinching.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.722597",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.722597",
    "uid": "quote-000072"
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "text": "Growth is rarely loud; more often, it unfolds quietly, like petals opening to reveal the flower within.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.745607",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.745607",
    "uid": "quote-000076"
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "text": "Growth begins where silence replaces the need to be heard.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.765204",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.765204",
    "uid": "quote-000079"
  },
  {
    "id": 83,
    "text": "Silence is not weakness—it’s the forge where strength is shaped.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 1,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.793670",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.793670",
    "uid": "quote-000083"
  },
  {
    "id": 88,
    "text": "Growth is the harvest of moments when you chose restraint over reaction.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.822704",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.822704",
    "uid": "quote-000088"
  },
  {
    "id": 91,
    "text": "To rise above, sink into the quiet depths of your own resolve.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.843433",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.843433",
    "uid": "quote-000091"
  },
  {
    "id": 95,
    "text": "In silence, you hear the voice of your truest self unfolding.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.878089",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.878089",
    "uid": "quote-000095"
  },
  {
    "id": 97,
    "text": "The deepest growth roots itself in the soil of quiet reflection.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.891756",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.891756",
    "uid": "quote-000097"
  },
  {
    "id": 101,
    "text": "Every silent moment you claim builds the fortress of your peace.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.916926",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.916926",
    "uid": "quote-000101"
  },
  {
    "id": 104,
    "text": "Growth is the echo of silence answering the call of chaos.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.933380",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.933380",
    "uid": "quote-000104"
  },
  {
    "id": 113,
    "text": "Let silence be your reply to chaos, and growth will follow.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.996364",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.996364",
    "uid": "quote-000113"
  },
  {
    "id": 117,
    "text": "In the stillness of restraint, we hear the voice of progress.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.027841",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.027841",
    "uid": "quote-000117"
  },
  {
    "id": 119,
    "text": "To grow is to tame the storm within before it wrecks the world outside.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.041911",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.041911",
    "uid": "quote-000119"
  },
  {
    "id": 122,
    "text": "Growth begins where the ego ends.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.060466",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.060466",
    "uid": "quote-000122"
  },
  {
    "id": 126,
    "text": "The moment you pause instead of explode is the moment you evolve.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 1,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.090171",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.090171",
    "uid": "quote-000126"
  },
  {
    "id": 127,
    "text": "Growth doesn’t always roar—sometimes, it whispers, 'Wait.'",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.098850",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.098850",
    "uid": "quote-000127"
  },
  {
    "id": 131,
    "text": "The path to growth is paved with steps of restraint.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.146718",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.146718",
    "uid": "quote-000131"
  },
  {
    "id": 132,
    "text": "Anger screams for attention; growth listens in quiet.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.157733",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.157733",
    "uid": "quote-000132"
  },
  {
    "id": 136,
    "text": "Each moment you choose peace over rage, you choose a better version of you.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.193259",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.193259",
    "uid": "quote-000136"
  },
  {
    "id": 142,
    "text": "Growth is slow because wisdom walks, not runs.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.248500",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.248500",
    "uid": "quote-000142"
  },
  {
    "id": 150,
    "text": "Growth begins where comfort ends—embrace the struggle.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.323906",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.323906",
    "uid": "quote-000150"
  },
  {
    "id": 154,
    "text": "You are not defined by your past, but by the lessons you carry forward.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.364233",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.364233",
    "uid": "quote-000154"
  },
  {
    "id": 158,
    "text": "Every step forward, no matter how small, is a victory over stagnation.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.397374",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.397374",
    "uid": "quote-000158"
  },
  {
    "id": 162,
    "text": "Growth is painful, but stagnation is fatal—choose your struggle.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.442304",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.442304",
    "uid": "quote-000162"
  },
  {
    "id": 166,
    "text": "The seed of greatness lies in the soil of self-improvement—water it daily.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 1,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.479412",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.479412",
    "uid": "quote-000166"
  },
  {
    "id": 170,
    "text": "You grow not by chance, but by choice—make it deliberately.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.522671",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.522671",
    "uid": "quote-000170"
  },
  {
    "id": 174,
    "text": "ترقی مشکل راستوں سے گزر کر ہی ملتی ہے۔",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.562691",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.562691",
    "uid": "quote-000174"
  },
  {
    "id": 178,
    "text": "خود کو بدلنا ہی سب سے بڑی کامیابی ہے۔",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Personal Growth",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "forest",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.608544",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-07T14:11:12.366722",
    "uid": "quote-000178"
  }
]
